Bones Have Eyes was the [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] that held the fane at the middle of [[Geography/Færrin/Raelion/Orilon/index|Orilon]]. Its body was a tree of bone grown out of a single skull set on an altar: the trunk a mass of human bones fused together, the branches arms and legs knit one into another.

Its fane was an ossuary, dressed to be beautiful, with marble floors and columns and walls of black stone worked over with bone. Skulls were piled along the walls as ornament, and braziers burned with a flame that ran from orange into green.

Priests and deacons of [[Divinity/Outer Gods/The Compelled|The Compelled]] served the fane under a foremost, the strongest and best blessed of them. Bones Have Eyes went with the city.
